{
  "id": "E221",
  "title": "Clients Arriving",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-05-09",
  "synopsis": "What do you need to do before the clients arrive?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/733/d88ea02911e53aa7083058b7ec4ec4d34425ecea.mp3?1525687518",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "客户快到了\n\n小张：王总，德国的客户说他们明天下午会到中国。\n王总：好，他们的飞机几点到？\n小张：下午三点一刻。\n王总：接机的人安排好了吗？\n小张：安排好了。\n王总：酒店订好了吗？\n小张：也订好了。\n王总：很好，明天上午你再打电话确认一下。\n小张：好的。",
    "traditional": "客戶快到了\n\n小張：王總，德國的客戶說他們明天下午會到中國。\n王總：好，他們的飛機幾點到？\n小張：下午三點一刻。\n王總：接機的人安排好了嗎？\n小張：安排好了。\n王總：酒店訂好了嗎？\n小張：也訂好了。\n王總：很好，明天上午你再打電話確認一下。\n小張：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The clients are about to arrive"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：王总，德国的客户说他们明天下午会到中国。",
      "traditional": "小張：王總，德國的客戶說他們明天下午會到中國。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wáng zǒng dé guó de kè hù shuō tā men míng tiān xià wǔ huì dào zhōng guó",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Manager Wang, our German clients said they will arrive in China tomorrow afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "王总：好，他们的飞机几点到？",
      "traditional": "王總：好，他們的飛機幾點到？",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng hǎo tā men de fēi jī jǐ diǎn dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Ok. What time will their flight arrive?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：下午三点一刻。",
      "traditional": "小張：下午三點一刻。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng xià wǔ sān diǎn yí kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: A quarter past three in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "王总：接机的人安排好了吗？",
      "traditional": "王總：接機的人安排好了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng jiē jī de rén ān pái hǎo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Have you arranged for someone to pick them up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：安排好了。",
      "traditional": "小張：安排好了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng ān pái hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Yes, it’s been arranged."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "王总：酒店订好了吗？",
      "traditional": "王總：酒店訂好了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng jiǔ diàn dìng hǎo le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Is the hotel booked?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小张：也订好了。",
      "traditional": "小張：也訂好了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng yě dìng hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Yes, this is also done."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "王总：很好，明天上午你再打电话确认一下。",
      "traditional": "王總：很好，明天上午你再打電話確認一下。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng hěn hǎo míng tiān shàng wǔ nǐ zài dǎ diàn huà què rèn yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Good. Remember to give them a confirmation call tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小张：好的。",
      "traditional": "小張：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Ok."
    }
  ],
