      "The clients are about to arrive",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Manager Wang, our German clients said they will arrive in China tomorrow afternoon.",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: Ok. What time will their flight arrive?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: A quarter past three in the afternoon.",
      "",
      "Manager Wang: Have you arranged for someone to pick them up?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Yes, it’s been arranged.",
      "",
